OL,3,GNEWSABarred MP 'had no intention of
OL,4,Avisiting Israel'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP banned from entering Israel in
OL,7,Fresponse to the UK announcing sanctions
OL,8,Fon illegal Israeli settlements in the
OL,9,Foccupied West Bank, said she has no
OL,10,Fintention of visiting the country
OL,11,Fanyway.
OL,13,FEllie Chowns, who represents North
OL,14,FHerefordshire for the Greens, was one
OL,15,Fof 12 people recently barred from the
OL,16,Fcountry. Israel's foreign minister
OL,17,FGideon Saar said the move was in
OL,18,Fresponse to sanctions.
OL,20,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband announced
OL,21,Fthe sanctions on Wednesday with Israel
OL,22,Flater announcing counter-measures.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
