OL,3,GNEWSABarred MP 'had no intention of
OL,4,Avisiting Israel'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChowns told the BBC she had rejected an
OL,7,Finvite to Israel from an "international
OL,8,Fpeace organisation", due to concerns
OL,9,Fover whether she would be stopped from
OL,10,Fentering.
